## Generation Rules

- Start each section with the EXACT marker `## SECTION_{{ "N" }}:` where N is the section number. Section content follows immediately.
- Write from the perspective of a senior SAP Technical Consultant / Technical Architect — every FSD requirement covered in this batch must be translated to a concrete technical design
- Every section must use at least one of: structured prose, a table, or a bulleted list — no unstructured walls of text
- ABAP or code samples, if any, belong only in clearly labelled code blocks — never inline in prose
- Where the FSD is silent and no clarification was given, record a technical assumption — never invent a requirement
